# Branches and pull requests

Work on `dev` unless the user explicitly asks for a feature branch.

If they ask for a feature branch, name it `cursor/<name>-25a8` and open that PR against `dev`.

When the work is already on `dev` and they ask for a PR, open it from `dev` to `main`. Do not create a feature branch for that.

`main` is updated only by merging `dev`.
